{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>In a world where the fae-touched fall prey to a sinister killer, only a faeologist can uncover the truth.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/Banner.png?t=1749556940\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/divider1.png?t=1749556940\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/choice.gif?t=1749556940\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick dialogue options that will lead you to certain endings, including romantic ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/investigation.gif?t=1749556940\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact using your tools to investigate the evidence. You have a magnifying glass, a blacklight to detect faerie magic, and a faerie encyclopedia at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/interview.gif?t=1749556940\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interview select characters to gather crucial information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/deduction.gif?t=1749556940\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Present your findings to the detective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genderless protagonist with a customizable name.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between rekindling your past romance with <strong>the detective</strong> (M), indulging in the mature charm of your <strong>patron</strong> (M), nurturing a gothic romance with <strong>the assistant</strong> (F), straying your <strong>childhood friend</strong> (F) into an intoxicating love, or simply being contented with yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various endings depending on your choices and the accuracy of your deduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/divider3.png?t=1749556940\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a renowned faeologist in 1920s New York who has\u00a0been tasked with solving a chilling crime:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>&quot;Bizarre murders happening across the upper echelons of New York society, with the mystery deepening with every clue.&quot;</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the clues with your fae expertise and keen investigative tools such as a magnifying glass and a blacklight, and gather vital information by interviewing those who hold fragments of the truth, all while navigating your allegiance between a relentless detective and your enigmatic patron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you unravel the truth and cement the importance of faeology in a world that relegates it to the realm of pseudoscience?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/divider4.png?t=1749556940\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short introduction to the four love interests in Death &amp; Faeology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/introduction4.jpg?t=1749556940\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3369020?t=1749556940","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749556940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/85f5685ea6f533df952e1c2e851e35458a9a885e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749556940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/85f5685ea6f533df952e1c2e851e35458a9a885e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749556940","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3533950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>In a world where the fae-touched fall prey to a sinister killer, only a faeologist can uncover the truth.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/Banner.png?t=1749556940\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/divider1.png?t=1749556940\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/choice.gif?t=1749556940\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick dialogue options that will lead you to certain endings, including romantic ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>